t gonna be  talking to your family about it there's  no way you're gonna get to the top  because you don't love it enough so if  you have this secret idea that you  really want to be an entrepreneur and  you're forced to then go get a job  because that's what society says is the  safe thing to do that's actually the  riskiest thing to do because you're  handing your life over to somebody else  and you're doing something that you're  not absolutely passionate about so  although it's scary although you're  venturing into the unknown although you  may be doing something that your family  and friends don't agree with you have to  follow your heart with all big decisions  and if that company something you want  to do you have to go and do it thank you  guys so much for watching my question of  the day for you is I'd love to know  somebody in your life whether it's  yourself or a family member or a friend  who was like Jim Carrey's dad who did  the smart thing the safe thing and it  ended up falling apart on them I'd love  to hear those stories if you want to  leave it in the comments below because I  think it can help inspire a lot of  people to want  that step so if you have that story  please share it in the comments below  and of course if you like this video and  you want to see more don't forget to  subscribe to the channel and the  newsletter have a fantastic day I hope  I'll see you again tomorrow morning at 7  a.m. to help kick start your day with  another inspirational video believe
 

